     Cell[TextData[{Cell[BoxData[StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", 
         FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], " and ", 
        Cell[BoxData[StyleBox["boundaryDirection", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", 
         FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], " are two- or three-component \
