, Cell[BoxData[StyleBox["boundaryDirection", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", 
         FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], 
        ", then ordered by displacement norm within each group."}], "Notes", 
      CellID -> 628755215], 
     Cell[TextData[{"The implementation accepts cell associations of lengths \
", Cell[BoxData["4"], "InlineFormula", FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], 
        ", ", Cell[BoxData["7"], "InlineFormula", FontFamily -> 
          "Source Sans Pro"], ", ", Cell[BoxData["8"], "InlineFormula", 
