         "InlineFormula", FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], ", ", 
        Cell[BoxData["15"], "InlineFormula", FontFamily -> 
          "Source Sans Pro"], ", or ", Cell[BoxData["19"], "InlineFormula", 
         FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], ". Their arrangement must provide \
the representative cells required by the grouped indexing."}], "Notes", 
      CellID -> 998164651], Cell[TextData[{"For lengths ", 
        Cell[BoxData["4"], "InlineFormula", FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], 
        ", ", Cell[BoxData["8"], "InlineFormula", FontFamily -> 
